{"availability":"available","full":"yakhyo/retinaface-pytorch","name":"retinaface-pytorch","description":"RetinaFace face detection in PyTorch - training, WIDER FACE evaluation, ONNX export and real-time inference with pretrained weights.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":82,"forks":11,"created":"2024-10-19T12:09:39Z","updated":"2026-04-02T00:47:03Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://yakhyo.github.io/retinaface-pytorch/","topics":["onnxruntime","retinaface","retinaface-detector","retinaface-pytorch"],"demo":"https://yakhyo.github.io/retinaface-pytorch/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T04:52:20.868Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T04:52:20.868Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T04:52:20.868Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T04:52:20.868Z","stars":82,"forks":11}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The models and functionality in this repository are integrated into UniFace — an all-in-one face analysis library.","This is a face detection model for high-precision facial localization based on RetinaFace: Single-stage Dense Face Localisation in the Wild. This model accurately detects facial landmarks and bounding boxes for faces in images. This repository provides custom training & inference code, and several new backbone models have been integrated for improved performance and flexibility.","We've updated the codebase with new trained models and a refactored structure, enhancing functionality and maintainability. These improvements include support for MobileNetV1 (including v1025 and v1050), MobileNetV2, and various ResNet versions (18, 34, 50), offering a cleaner and more reproducible experience."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yakhyo/retinaface-pytorch/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2a45028f96cc65ea7ebf4b5473133c1ff537534153b856932596df49c084119e","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T04:52:20.959Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T04:52:20.959Z","projectInsights